cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "From Scene Events to Video-Feed Failures: replication package (Supplementary S1–S5)"
message: If you use this replication package, please cite the accompanying systematic review.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Rehman
    given-names: Tayyab
repository-code: https://github.com/tayyabrehman96/From-Scene-Events-to-Video-Feed-Failures
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: "2026-08-31"
abstract: >-
  Versioned replication package (Supplementary S1–S5) for the systematic review
  of visual anomaly detection in surveillance. Contains database search
  specifications and evidence-freeze log; bibliographic inventory; core
  consolidated performance evidence and aggregate appraisal results; numerical
  provenance; a complete 43-cell/903-pair protocol-comparability audit; a
  21-corpus dataset audit with split, access, and composition fields; and
  validation scripts with checksums. Does not
  redistribute video datasets or manuscript LaTeX.
keywords:
  - systematic review
  - video anomaly detection
  - surveillance
  - PRISMA
  - reproducibility
